{"availability":"available","full":"NoelPOS/codepilot","name":"codepilot","description":"AI prompt-to-code workspace: describe an app, get React code with a live in-browser preview. Bring your own Gemini key.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2025-04-16T15:14:56Z","updated":"2026-10-08T06:40:45Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://codepilot-pro.vercel.app","topics":["ai","code-generation","convex","gemini-api","nextjs","react","sandpack"],"demo":"https://codepilot-pro.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:26.328Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:26.328Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:26.328Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T02:09:26.328Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Describe an app in plain English and get a running React project, with a live editor and preview in the browser.","Live demo · Architecture decisions · Configuration guide","CodePilot is a prompt-to-app workspace in the style of Bolt.new. You describe what you want, such as \"an expense tracker with a monthly chart\", and Google Gemini writes a multi-file React project. The project runs immediately in a CodeSandbox Sandpack editor and preview. Follow-up prompts edit the same project, and every workspace is saved to your account."],"features":["Prompt or starter template: start from a blank prompt or one of 8 templates (todo, dashboard, landing page, portfolio, quiz, expense tracker, weather and more).","Streaming assistant reply: a short explanation streams into the chat while the code is generated alongside it.","Multi-file React output: an App.js plus components/ and utils/, styled with Tailwind. Common libraries are preinstalled: lucide-react, react-router-dom, chart.js, date-fns and others.","Iterate in place: follow-up prompts get the current files and recent chat as context, so Gemini edits the project instead of starting over.","Full workspace: file explorer, editor tabs, live preview and a toggleable console, in a split or a floating chat layout."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NoelPOS/codepilot/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"02133c85b239ea9305a084a1c52e9eb341b231f9354d85707112f71d790a48c2","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:26.475Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:26.475Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Describe an app in plain English and get a running React project, with a live editor and preview in the browser.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NoelPOS/codepilot/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Google sign-in, light/dark/system theme, and clear messages when you hit Gemini's rate limits.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NoelPOS/codepilot/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"It needs three events: setupintent.succeeded, invoice.paid and customer.subscription.deleted.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NoelPOS/codepilot/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Auth hardening: Convex functions aren't yet tied to the Google sign-in, so ownership checks happen on the client.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NoelPOS/codepilot/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"02133c85b239ea9305a084a1c52e9eb341b231f9354d85707112f71d790a48c2","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NoelPOS/codepilot/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:26.476Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T06:40:45Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NoelPOS/codepilot/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T02:09:26.477Z","hash":"02133c85b239ea9305a084a1c52e9eb341b231f9354d85707112f71d790a48c2","originalBytes":8196,"storedBytes":8196,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["convex","google","stripe","next","gemini","key","app","public","react","billing","only","preview","webhook","api","client","files"